## 6.0.0 (2026-10-30)

Breaking changes:
* The `--eliom` mode generates code using the module names introduced by
  Eliom 13 (`Eliom.Reference`, `Eliom.Common`, `Eliom.Content`). The
  generated code therefore requires Eliom >= 13; use ocsigen-i18n 5.x to
  generate code for Eliom <= 12. The other modes are unchanged.
  The opam package conflicts with Eliom < 13, so that an upgrade does not
  break an Eliom 12 project.
* OCaml >= 4.14 is required.

Fixes:
* The generator reports write errors on its output (for example a full
  disk) instead of exiting successfully with a truncated file.

## 5.0.0

See the git history for changes up to this release.
